          <description xml:base="https://lzon.ca/news/news-000029-glp1-aging/">&lt;p&gt;Researchers from the University of California analyzed data from a recent study to determine if semaglutide had anti aging effects. They discovered that study participants who received the drug had non-trivially improved markers of biological aging.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;</description>
